--- D: PL!SP-bp4-023-L Dazzling Game Q187 exclude_selected ---
EXPECTED_GAP(2): the step-2 exclusion is UNOBSERVABLE, but NOT because the field is undecoded -- the dump above shows `extra exclude_selected = true` IS carried in AbilityEffect::extra_k/extra_v. The real gap is upstream: the same select decodes as `src=(null) dst=(null) tgt=(null)`, i.e. AbilityEffect has NO source/target field, and the prompt it raises is offered over zone="hand" instead of the stage (the assertion above). A hand-offered pool has no notion of the already-chosen STAGE member, so `exclude_selected` cannot be honoured. The step-1 blade grant is asserted strictly as the paired positive that proves the fixture is live; the exclusion is NOT claimed as a pass. A second CSV is also in play here: `extra characters = 澁谷かのん,ウィーン・マルガレーテ,鬼塚冬毬`.
